# Text files are stored and checked out with LF line endings on every system. The scripts in bin/
# and dev/wordpress/ run inside Linux containers and break with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Calendar fixtures are compared byte for byte (the iCalendar format itself uses CRLF).
*.ics -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.mo binary
